# App packages are verified byte for byte: PROVENANCE.json and the generated App index
# record a sha256 of each packaged file. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf would
# rewrite LF to CRLF and every digest would stop matching, so git leaves these files
# exactly as committed.
backend/apps/** -text
# The generated App index is compared byte for byte with a fresh render on every build
# (generate_app_registry --check); a CRLF checkout made it read as stale on Windows.
backend/generated/** -text
